    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COUCH PvP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to eight people from the same couch. Share a single screen while competing with your friends (or enemies), ensuring there is never a quiet moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/ad3e40de868830c3c5a0df9e66313c1a.poster.avif?t=1753882523\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/ad3e40de868830c3c5a0df9e66313c1a.webm?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/ad3e40de868830c3c5a0df9e66313c1a.mp4?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTENSE ONLINE MATCH-UPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If online multiplayer is more your grove, connect to other lobbies and\u00a0wreak havoc. Bring your friends from your mega couch or just yourself when taking on strangers in intense matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/106e23394fc395b7bfeb84d6197e0096.poster.avif?t=1753882523\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/106e23394fc395b7bfeb84d6197e0096.webm?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/106e23394fc395b7bfeb84d6197e0096.mp4?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A VARIETY OF DIFFERENT MINIGAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your skills when playing one of the many high-octane minigames and levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Western Standoff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive-thru</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dave Directs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mexican Standoff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot Potato</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/8e17df84d1550f1cf4dc327934fa62a2.poster.avif?t=1753882523\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/8e17df84d1550f1cf4dc327934fa62a2.webm?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/8e17df84d1550f1cf4dc327934fa62a2.mp4?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COUCH PvP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to eight people from the same couch. Share a single screen while competing with your friends (or enemies), ensuring there is never a quiet moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/ad3e40de868830c3c5a0df9e66313c1a.poster.avif?t=1753882523\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/ad3e40de868830c3c5a0df9e66313c1a.webm?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/ad3e40de868830c3c5a0df9e66313c1a.mp4?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTENSE ONLINE MATCH-UPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If online multiplayer is more your grove, connect to other lobbies and\u00a0wreak havoc. Bring your friends from your mega couch or just yourself when taking on strangers in intense matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/106e23394fc395b7bfeb84d6197e0096.poster.avif?t=1753882523\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/106e23394fc395b7bfeb84d6197e0096.webm?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/106e23394fc395b7bfeb84d6197e0096.mp4?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A VARIETY OF DIFFERENT MINIGAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your skills when playing one of the many high-octane minigames and levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Western Standoff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive-thru</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dave Directs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mexican Standoff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot Potato</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/8e17df84d1550f1cf4dc327934fa62a2.poster.avif?t=1753882523\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/8e17df84d1550f1cf4dc327934fa62a2.webm?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828560/extras/8e17df84d1550f1cf4dc327934fa62a2.mp4?t=1753882523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
